 while reaching 31,33,35 and 49.  I had pre-written that conclusion and it printed
 regardless of the result.  Settling it exhaustively instead.

 perfect matchings of K_8: 105  (expect (n-1)!! = 105)
 fixed path arcs: 7;  free tiles: 21 (= C(n-1,2) = 21)
 |Pf| is a SWITCHING-CLASS invariant (Pf(DSD) = det(D) Pf(S)) : True
 => |Pf| is a function on the 2^21 TILINGS, not on all 2^28 tournaments.  Exhaustive.

